# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Upstash Redis (optional, strongly recommended)
#
# A cold snapshot build touches ~140 third-party endpoints. With Redis the
# result is shared across instances and survives deploys, so a page view is a
# single cache read. Create a database at https://console.upstash.com/redis and
# copy the REST credentials.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=""
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Artemis (optional)
#
# The chain universe, logos, brand colours and descriptions come from Artemis'
# open asset directory and need no key. Daily active addresses and transaction
# counts sit behind their API — set a key to switch those columns on.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ARTEMIS_API_KEY=""
